component r2e
export Executable
(*) Repair R2, the two mechanisms that carry literal arithmetic on the compile
(*) path: INTEGERLITERALFOLDING folds a whole literal expression exactly before
(*) the type checker runs, while arithmetic through two bindings runs rung 7's
(*) IntLiteral helpers on the emitted values.  The first prints the true sum
(*) today; the second does not.
run() = do
    println (4294967295 + 1)
    a = 4294967295
    b = 1
    println (a + b)
end
end
